# Raw corpora refetch; the derived receipts do not, because the source moves.
#
# Per webprobes/doctrine/condensed-receipts.md: the zips are ~1.3 GB and USAspending
# regenerates them on request, so they are never committed. The receipts below are the
# evidence for the figures -- 297 KB against 1.3 GB -- and without them nothing here can
# be checked or redrawn. Exclude the directory's contents, then name what stays, the same
# way this repo promotes named files rather than directories.
artifacts/data/*
*
!.gitignore
!categories-fy2016.json
!comparability.json
!condensed-fy2015.json
!condensed-fy2016.json
!condensed-fy2017.json
!farlines.json
!geo-3yr.json
!modauth-fy2016.json
!offers-civilian-fy2016.json
!schedule-civilian-fy2015.json
!schedule-civilian-fy2016.json
!thresholds.json
!vehicles-fy2016.json
# 2.0 MB, and it is the only receipt for two figures. Above the usual 512 KB bar and
# argued for explicitly rather than let through.
!notice-fy2016.json
